 {"name":"19 Bar","city":"minneapolis","type":"bar","description":"Minneapolis's historic cash-only gay neighbourhood bar, reopened after fire restoration, with pool, darts, jukebox, patio, karaoke and affordable drinks.","hours":"Monday-Friday 15:00-02:00; Saturday-Sunday 13:00-02:00.","link":"https://www.facebook.com/19BarMinneapolis/","location":"19 West 15th Street, Minneapolis, MN 55403, USA","lat":44.967492,"lng":-93.278811,"vibe":"low-key historic gay bar favouring conversation, pool and neighbourhood regulars","q":"Usually easier than dance clubs; cash-only service and small peak-night capacity deserve preparation.","best":"Early evening for regular-bar atmosphere, karaoke or weekend patio hours for more energy.","crowd":"Multigenerational gay regulars, broader queer locals, pool players and visitors.","dress":"Unfussy casual clothing.","staff":"Official Minneapolis tourism confirms current operation after the fire and its historic gay identity.","sources":["https://www.minneapolis.org/lgbtq-community/bars-clubs/","https://www.minneapolis.org/things-to-do/music-nightlife/food-entertainment/"]},
