 {"name":"Pride Cymru Community Information","city":"cardiff","type":"other","provider":"Pride Cymru","contact":"Use official contact and volunteer routes","booking":"https://pridecymru.com/","description":"Wales-wide LGBTQ+ charity and Cardiff festival organiser providing community events, campaigning, volunteering and official Pride access information rather than a daily drop-in centre.","hours":"Online year-round; physical access follows published events and appointments.","link":"https://pridecymru.com/","location":"Cardiff, Wales, United Kingdom","lat":51.481600,"lng":-3.179100,"vibe":"national Welsh LGBTQ+ organising connecting festival visibility, community programmes and equality work","lead":"Contact early for volunteering, access, stalls, media or partnership; festival deadlines close months ahead.","best":"Use current official channels before attending any physical event or relying on an old office address.","crowd":"LGBTQ+ people across Wales, community groups, volunteers, families, performers and allies.","prep":"State whether the request concerns access, welfare, volunteering, parade or community referral.","incl":"Pride Cymru is an LGBTQ+ charity and publishes quiet-hour, welfare and access provisions.","sources":["https://pridecymru.com/","https://pridecymru.com/events/"]}
